@startuml
title Iterative and Incremental Development Methodology

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #F7F9FC
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
  DiamondBackgroundColor #EAF2FF
  DiamondBorderColor #175CD3
}

start
:Review project brief, assessment rubric,\nliterature, and supervisor feedback;

while (More prioritised requirements?) is (Yes)
  :Define and prioritise module requirements;
  :Design architecture, database model,\nAPI contracts, and interface flows;
  :Implement a small functional increment;
  :Run unit, build, API, and workflow checks;

  while (Requirements and behaviour acceptable?) is (No)
    :Revise requirement, design,\nor implementation;
    :Reimplement the functional increment;
    :Repeat relevant verification checks;
  endwhile (Yes)

  :Integrate increment into the\nworking full-stack system;
endwhile (No)

:Evaluate objectives, limitations,\nand implementation evidence;
:Prepare report, presentation,\nand demonstration;

stop
@enduml
